course: dictionary
lesson: 6352
title: Many meanings of moving
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word moving has several meanings, and the sentence around it tells you which one to use. Moving is the -ing form of move, so it often means going or carrying something now. «A moving bike stays up because the rider steers into any lean.» Here moving means the bike is going, not standing still.
explain: Moving can also mean changing homes. «Moving day» is the day a family leaves one house and goes to live in another. The words day and truck, as in «moving truck», are clues that the word is about a new home. Ask yourself: what does the word next to it tell me?
explain: Moving can mean touching your feelings. A moving story or song makes you feel strong feelings, often sad or kind. The meaning is not about motion at all. Check it by swapping in another word: in «a moving story», could you say «a touching story»? If yes, you have the right meaning.
explain: A quick check helps. Put your meaning into the sentence and read it again. «Keep away from moving cars and machines» only makes sense if moving means going or working right now. If your meaning sounds silly, try another one from the list.
fact: Moving is the -ing form of move, so it can act like a verb or an adjective.
fact: «A moving car» is a car that is going, not still.
fact: «Moving day» is the day you go to live in a new home.
fact: «A moving story» makes you feel strong feelings, often sad or kind.
fact: Bulls charge the «moving cape», not its colour, so a bull will charge a moving cape of any colour: never go into a field with a bull.
exercise: «A moving bike stays up because the rider steers into any lean.» In this sentence, moving means | *Going along, not standing still | Being sad or unhappy | Living in a new home | Wrapped up tight
exercise: Which phrase means the day a family goes to live in a new house? | *Moving day | Moving walkway | Keep moving | Moving dot
exercise: «The story was so moving that Mia cried.» What does moving suggest? | It was going along fast | She was moving house | *It made her feel strong feelings | It was very cold and wet
test: «The International Space Station is a bright moving dot in the sky.» Here moving means | A new house for astronauts | A story that makes you sad | *Going across the sky, not staying still | Moving to a different planet
test: Which is the best meaning of «a moving song»? | One that is going along the road | One that tells you where to live | *One that touches your heart and stirs strong feelings | Pretty, with a lovely tune
exam: In «The moving walkway carried the shoppers along», what does moving mean? | A story that touches your feelings | *Going along right now | Changing to a new home | Still and quiet
